      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60beef08cb1b3a0913dabd4c|full_name} Marshmallow PB is merely a good example of the issue but its not doing anything different then any setup using physbones resting on colliders. It could very well be a problem with how plane colliders dynamicly scale but ive not tested avatars with skirts that use capsules in their legs etc(after patch). Those of which were jittering badly stationary before the recent physbone change(that aparently fixed that) in unity for me and its why i opted to not use such assets but may recheck some today.",
